## 📋 Scripts

### Monitoring/

| Script | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Check-DiskSpace.ps1` | Checks free disk space across multiple servers. Configurable threshold with color-coded warnings. CSV export. Designed for scheduled task automation |
| `Check-SSLCertExpiry.ps1` | Validates SSL certificate expiry dates for Exchange OWA, SMTP/TLS, ADFS, VPN portal, and intranet services. Flags certificates expiring within configurable warning period |
| `Watch-CriticalServices.ps1` | Monitors critical Windows services on DC, Exchange, file server, and backup server. Optional `-AutoRestart` flag to automatically recover stopped services |
| `Check-WindowsUpdates.ps1` | Scans servers for pending Windows updates, identifies critical patches, and detects systems requiring reboot. Flags outdated machines |

### Network/

| Script | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Manage-DNS.ps1` | DNS record management: list all records (A, CNAME, MX), add/remove records, detect stale entries (90+ days), zone health check with scavenging status and forwarder audit |
| `Get-DHCPReport.ps1` | DHCP scope utilization with visual progress bars, active lease inventory, reservation list, and server statistics (discover/offer/ack/nack counters) |
| `Scan-Network.ps1` | Ping sweep across IP range with hostname resolution and MAC address lookup. Optional `-ScanPorts` flag scans common ports (RDP, SMB, HTTP, SQL, SSH) and identifies running services |

### Backup/

| Script | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Get-BackupStatus.ps1` | Veeam Backup & Replication job status report. Shows last job result, duration, and repository disk usage. Alerts on failed or warning jobs |

### Security/

| Script | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Get-SharePermissions.ps1` | Audits NTFS and Share-level permissions on file server shares. Flags dangerous "Everyone" access. Exports full permission matrix to CSV |

