## 🚀 Usage

```powershell
# Clone
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/windows-infra-monitor.git
cd windows-infra-monitor

# --- Monitoring ---
.\Monitoring\Check-DiskSpace.ps1 -ThresholdPercent 15
.\Monitoring\Check-SSLCertExpiry.ps1 -WarningDays 30
.\Monitoring\Watch-CriticalServices.ps1 -AutoRestart
.\Monitoring\Check-WindowsUpdates.ps1

# --- Network ---
.\Network\Manage-DNS.ps1 -Action Report -ZoneName "yourdomain.com"
.\Network\Get-DHCPReport.ps1 -DHCPServer "DC01" -WarningPercent 80
.\Network\Scan-Network.ps1 -Subnet "192.168.1" -ScanPorts

# --- Backup ---
.\Backup\Get-BackupStatus.ps1 -Hours 24

# --- Security ---
.\Security\Get-SharePermissions.ps1 -ServerName "FILESERVER" -ExportCSV
```

